# Redirect HTTP to HTTPS
http://suffolkcrawlspace.com/* https://suffolkcrawlspace.com/:splat 301

# Redirect www to non-www
https://www.suffolkcrawlspace.com/* https://suffolkcrawlspace.com/:splat 301

# Clean URLs are handled natively by Cloudflare Pages: it serves /repair
# from repair.html and 308-redirects the .html form to the clean one with
# no configuration. Explicit .html <-> clean-URL rules here fought that
# native behavior and produced an infinite redirect loop on all 8 backpages
# (about, contact, dehumidifier, drainage, encapsulation, repair,
# vapor-barrier, waterproofing) from July 27 to Sept 1, 2026. The identical
# bug hit platypusautomations.com/_redirects and was fixed there Aug 1 --
# this file just never got the same fix. Do not re-add those rules.
# Verify with: curl -sI https://suffolkcrawlspace.com/repair

# Serve index.html for directory without redirect (200 = rewrite, not redirect)
/ /index.html 200
